<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<div style=""><div style=""><div style=""><font face="arial"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Dear </span><b>{!Case.Account}</b><span style="font-size: 12pt;">,</span></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;&nbsp;<b>{!Case.PMC_SS_Location__c}</b> has reported a low stock or no stock of<b>&nbsp;{!Case.Product}</b> . To prevent immediate inconvenience&nbsp;<span style="font-size: 12pt;">to your</span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">shipping plans we wish to advise the following orders identified.</span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><ul><li>Customer PO number</li><li>Mosaic order number</li></ul></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">We apologize for the impact to your business. Resupply is currently in progress and ETA is scheduled for&nbsp;<span style="font-size: 12pt;">MM/DD/YY. As product becomes available, we will notify you once you can resume pick-up. Please</span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">reach out to your Customer Service Representative for further questions</div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><br></div><div style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font face="arial"><b>{!Case.OwnerFullName}</b></font></div></div></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>